menu "IR frame types"

    config IR_FRAME_MAX_EDGES
        int "Maximum level durations per captured IR frame"
        range 64 1024
        default 512
        help
            Upper bound on the number of mark/space durations stored for one
            captured frame. A typical NEC frame uses 68 edges; long air
            conditioner frames can exceed 300. Frames longer than this are
            rejected with an overflow event instead of being silently truncated.

endmenu
